# The trace generator lives in the Pin tracer and the post-pass, not here.
#
# Nothing in this directory hand-writes instructions any more. Function bodies
# are real C++ compiled into the benchmark, their program counters come from the
# compiler and linker, and the annotation pass reads what was actually executed.
# The previous generators are gone deliberately: they invented program counters,
# and everything they invented was wrong in the same direction.
.PHONY: all
all:
	@echo "nothing to build here yet -- see tracer/pin and the annotate pass"
